=== 10 FAILING CHECKPOINTS ===
--- ISSUE 1/10 ---
id: MOT-001
severity: serious
category: motion
found_by: static
title: Respect prefers-reduced-motion
problem: CSS motion exists but no prefers-reduced-motion query was found — motion can't be reduced for users who ask for less.
why_it_matters: Users with vestibular disorders or motion sensitivity can trigger migraines or disorientation from animation; the OS-level reduced-motion preference is their control.
standards: wcag:2.3.3
locations:
  - makercentral_v1/src/assets/styles/App.css:8:3 ~d4d3
       5|   color: var(--accent);
       6|   background: var(--accent-bg);
       7|   border: 2px solid transparent;
       8|   transition: border-color 0.3s; <<<
       9|   margin-bottom: 24px;
      10| 
      11|   &:hover {
  - makercentral_v1/src/assets/styles/App.css:128:5 ~4fe5
     125|     align-items: center;
     126|     gap: 8px;
     127|     text-decoration: none;
     128|     transition: box-shadow 0.3s; <<<
     129| 
     130|     &:hover {
     131|       box-shadow: var(--shadow);
fix: Add @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation: none; transition: none; } } or scoped equivalents.

