id: SEM-009
severity: serious
category: semantics
found_by: static
related: OPR-002 (cite the same line — one edit may resolve all)
title: Interactive controls use native button or anchor elements
problem: 10 non-native element(s) with a click handler — a <div>/<span> has no keyboard or AT semantics; use <button> for actions or <a href> for navigation.
why_it_matters: Clickable <div>s and <span>s have no native keyboard or AT semantics; users who don't use a mouse can't activate them.
