--- ISSUE 5/10 ---
id: TRU-001
severity: serious
category: trust-privacy
found_by: static
title: Add rel=noopener to target=_blank links
problem: 6 target="_blank" link(s) without rel="noopener" — a reverse-tabnabbing risk.
why_it_matters: Links that open a new tab grant the new page access to window.opener, enabling tab-napping attacks where the opener page is replaced with a phishing site.
standards: owasp:A05:2021
locations:
