id: OPR-023
severity: moderate
category: a11y-operable
found_by: static
related: SEM-001, SEM-004 (cite the same line — one edit may resolve all)
title: Pages have a meaningful sequence of headings for in-page navigation
problem: Heading-outline issues: 3 document(s) without exactly one h1 and 7 level skip(s) — long pages become hard to scan by heading.
why_it_matters: Screen-reader users navigate by headings; a missing or misordered heading hierarchy makes long pages difficult to scan.
